# The modules that were in the catalogue and are not any more. Their names, units
# and routes stay reserved for ever: a pull request that takes one of them, or that
# removes a published module without a line here, is refused (scripts/names.py).
#
# One line per retired module: <name> <unit> <route>, three words, in the patterns of
# the catalogue (a name like virt, a unit like casaos-virt-management.service, a
# route like /v2/virt_management); `-` for a module that had no route. A name, a
# unit or a route appears at most once in the file. Any other line refuses the file.
#
# No module is retired yet.
